 "description": "eth_estimateGas for a transfer or contract call you describe \u2014 the exact simulation a wallet runs before signing, without needing a wallet. Costs $0.001 USDC per call. Chains: base, ethereum, arbitrum, bsc, polygon, optimism, avalanche. Byte-identical to GET /chain/gas-estimate?chain=base&to=0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913&from=0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913&data=0x95d89b41&value=0.",
